To determine if the string `t8 t6 t8 t4 t9 t1` is generated by the given grammar, we use the CYK algorithm. The length of the string is n = 6. We will construct a table P[i][j] where P[i][j] contains the set of non-terminal symbols that can derive the substring from index i to j (1-indexed).

